//   - rule .mdc under ~/.cursor/rules/**         -> architect bless required (a second key).
// NOTE (sandbox reference): ~/.cursor/*.json (INCLUDING hooks.json) is always write-protected by the
// Seatbelt sandbox and will PROMPT even here — that is intended. Editing hook .sh scripts is free.
